  "title": "Hawaiian Wedding Cake",
  "description": "This Hawaiian wedding cake is easy to make by topping a layer of yellow cake with pineapple, fluffy cream, coconut, and nuts for a heavenly dessert.",
  "authors": [
    "Marcia"
  ],
